{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41691","headline":"题赠高闲上人 · 陈陶","name":"题赠高闲上人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"檐卜花间客，轩辕席上珍。\n笔江秋菡萏，僧国瑞麒麟。\n内殿初招隐，曹溪得後尘。\n龙蛇惊粉署，花雨对金轮。\n白马方依汉，朱星又入秦。\n剧谈凌凿齿，清论倒波旬。\n拂石先天古，降龙旧国春。\n珠还合浦老，龙去玉州贫。\n鸳鹭输黄绢，场坛遶白萍。\n鼎湖闲入梦，金阁静通神。\n海气成方丈，山泉落净巾。\n猕猴深爱月，鸥鸟不猜人。\n拂岳萧萧竹，垂空澹澹津。\n汉珠难觅对，荆璞本来真。\n伊傅多联壁，刘雷竞买邻。\n江边有国宝，时爲劚星辰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41691.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41691","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}